Copyright (c) 2026 Jimbus9 and contributors.

You can adapt anything here. What a Crowdlock never does is give supporters
anything financial back. Anything that pays a return is an investment.
Investments that pay returns must follow legal rules that protect the people
putting money in, and Crowdlock follows none of them. That is not what it is
for. See "What every Crowdlock shares" in running-your-own.md.
